    {
      "claim": "The effective in-geofence dwell is zero seconds against the 180 second free waiting period in force for this trip (trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec, STANDARD zone) - a shortfall of 180 seconds, with a longest qualifying run of 0 fixes. The driver's recorded speeds across the trace run from 57.2 to 62.9 km/h, which is a driver moving on a road, not a driver holding position at a pickup. Nor can he accumulate dwell: POL-NS-06(i) requires a present, populated traffic_advisory of type KERB_RESTRICTION, ENFORCEMENT, CLOSURE or ACCIDENT, and EV-ADVIS-02733-01 is MISSING (an absent artifact, weight 0.0, which I disclose), so limb (i) is unavailable by its own terms and a MISSING advisory can never reduce the minimum. The full refund stands and no driver compensation is payable.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-02733-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
